govenv-project-purpose-snapshot-v2
review-index 6
review-rationale "GV126 now establishes the internal reproducible Agda/ALS capability promised by the existing tooling direction; completing that substrate and advancing to reuse investigation strengthens execution of the existing purpose without changing the purpose itself."
purpose "Turn every repository into a self-governing developer environment: define what valid means once, let agents move fast without outrunning human authority, and reproduce the same tooling, automation, and runtime anywhere."
